{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04915","headline":"奉和幸大荐福寺 · 李乂","name":"奉和幸大荐福寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"象设隆新宇，龙潜想旧居。\n碧楼披玉额，丹仗导金舆。\n代日兴光近，周星掩曜初。\n空歌清沛筑，梵乐奏胡书。\n帝造环三界，天文贲六虚。\n康哉孝理日，崇德在真如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}